# REST Client (VS Code) / JetBrains HTTP client. Run `docker compose up` first.
@api = http://localhost:3000

### Portfolio of user 1 (seed: total 889756.00, available cash 627500.00)
GET {{api}}/users/1/portfolio

### Search by ticker or name
GET {{api}}/instruments?q=gal

### MARKET BUY 10 GGAL → 201 FILLED at the latest close
POST {{api}}/users/1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "instrumentId": 34, "side": "BUY", "type": "MARKET", "size": 10 }

### With an Idempotency-Key: send it twice → one order; the second answer has Idempotent-Replayed: true
POST {{api}}/users/1/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-1

{ "instrumentId": 34, "side": "BUY", "type": "MARKET", "size": 1 }

### MARKET BUY for 10000 ARS → the most whole shares it covers
POST {{api}}/users/1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "instrumentId": 34, "side": "BUY", "type": "MARKET", "amount": "10000" }

### LIMIT SELL 10 PAMP at 1000 → 201 NEW (holds 10 shares)
POST {{api}}/users/1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "instrumentId": 47, "side": "SELL", "type": "LIMIT", "size": 10, "price": "1000.00" }

### BUY more than available → 201 REJECTED INSUFFICIENT_FUNDS
POST {{api}}/users/1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "instrumentId": 50, "side": "BUY", "type": "MARKET", "size": 1000 }

### Cancel seed order 5 (NEW LIMIT BUY LOMA) → 200 CANCELLED; again → 409
POST {{api}}/users/1/orders/5/cancel
